<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility 96 net CZK 247 mln.</title>
<headline>Czech utility 96 net CZK 247 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final audited results for year ending December 31, 1996 (in millions of crowns.</p>
<p>				     1996	    1995</p>
<p> Total assets		  7,279.811    6,042.406</p>
<p> Current assets		  794.605	800.577</p>
<p> Own capital		   4,654.386    4,530.030</p>
<p> Basic capital		 3,420.175    3,224.463</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p> from sales of goods	     0.0	    0.0</p>
<p> Production		    8,884.186   8,608.299</p>
<p>Revenues from</p>
<p> products and services     8,842.573   8,506.141</p>
<p> Write offs			543.761     408.647</p>
<p> Operating result		459.912     609.227</p>
<p>Tax from income</p>
<p> for current activities	173.567     271.801</p>
<p>Result for</p>
<p> current activities	    248.137     272.919</p>
<p>Tax from income from</p>
<p> exceptional activities	 -0.037	 0.229</p>
<p> After tax profit		246.762     268.422</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		  420.292     540.452</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Severoceska Energetika a.s. It is a regional energy distributor.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
